__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.mcap
!samples/*.mcap
*.summary.json
# Keep the shipped sample's. Do not re-widen this: gates/conservation_audit.py
# reads its declared-dropped table from the summary beside the recording, and
# with the file ignored a fresh clone has no declarations, so the audit reports
# every deliberately-dropped input topic as unexplained. That happened once.
!samples/*.summary.json
render_proof/
node_modules/
